# INVWINW.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the item list at
# level 1 (READER), which is read-only.  ENTER shows the item form in
# view mode; CTRL-E, INS and DEL are each refused with INV's permission
# message, DEL without asking first.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINW.SNP is
# its snapshot.
T READER
K TAB
T Reader1986
K ENTER
S LIST
K ENTER
S VIEW
K ENTER
S BACK
K CTRL-E
S NOEDIT
K ENTER
K INS
S NONEW
K ENTER
K DEL
S NODEL
K ENTER
S END
